#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials instead of manually entering them"
msgstr "Zugangsdaten lokal speichern, statt sie jedes Mal manuell einzugeben"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials"
msgstr "Zugangsdaten speichern"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials {#save-your-login-credentials}"
msgstr "Zugangsdaten speichern {#save-your-login-credentials}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation), you can use the `save_account()` method to save your credentials locally, then use them to initialize the service.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du in einer vertrauenswürdigen Python-Umgebung arbeitest (z. B. auf deinem persönlichen Laptop oder deiner Workstation), kannst du die Methode `save_account()` verwenden, um deine Zugangsdaten lokal zu speichern und sie anschließend zur Initialisierung des Dienstes zu nutzen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"  * If you are using a public computer or other untrusted environment, follow the instructions in [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) instead.\n"
"  * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"  * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hinweise\">\n"
"      * Wenn du einen öffentlichen Computer oder eine andere nicht vertrauenswürdige Umgebung verwendest, folge stattdessen den Anweisungen unter [Den Dienst in einer nicht vertrauenswürdigen Umgebung initialisieren](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"      * Folge [diesen Anweisungen](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api), wenn du dich über die REST API statt über Qiskit verbinden möchtest.\n"
"      * Falls erforderlich, verwende [diese Informationen](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall), um deine Firewall so zu konfigurieren, dass der Zugriff auf die IBM Quantum API-Endpunkte möglich ist.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Vorbereitung {#before-you-begin}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [`qiskit` and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` packages installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr "Stelle sicher, dass du in einer aktiven Python-Umgebung mit den [installierten Paketen `qiskit` und `qiskit-ibm-runtime`](/guides/install-qiskit#local) arbeitest.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the Python virtual environment and run Python in your virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktiviere die virtuelle Python-Umgebung und führe Python darin aus.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Melde dich bei [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) an.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Zugangsdaten finden {#find-your-access-credentials}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr "Stelle sicher, dass das richtige Konto und die richtige Region im Konto-Umschalter im Header ausgewählt sind.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your API key. From the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. Note that you can use the same API key to connect to any region.\n"
msgstr "Finde deinen API-Schlüssel. Erstelle deinen API-Schlüssel im [Dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) und kopiere ihn an einen sicheren Ort, damit du ihn zur Authentifizierung verwenden kannst. Beachte, dass du denselben API-Schlüssel für die Verbindung zu jeder Region verwenden kannst.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr "Optional: Finde die Instanz, die du verwenden möchtest, auf der Seite [Instanzen](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Fahre mit der Maus über deren CRN, klicke auf das Symbol zum Kopieren und speichere sie an einem sicheren Ort, damit du sie zur Identifizierung der Instanz verwenden kannst.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your access credentials {#save-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Zugangsdaten speichern {#save-your-access-credentials}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your credentials by running the appropriate code once per account you want to save. After saving your credentials, load them by following the steps in [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account).\n"
msgstr "Speichere deine Zugangsdaten, indem du den entsprechenden Code einmal pro Konto ausführst, das du speichern möchtest. Lade deine gespeicherten Zugangsdaten anschließend, indem du die Schritte unter [IBM Quantum Compute Service initialisieren](/guides/initialize-account) befolgst.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save credentials that access a specific instance: {#save-credentials-that-access-a-specific-instance}"
msgstr "Zugangsdaten für eine bestimmte Instanz speichern: {#save-credentials-that-access-a-specific-instance}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have multiple instances and want to easily tell Quantum Compute which instance to use, save credentials that include an instance CRN.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du mehrere Instanzen hast und Quantum Compute einfach mitteilen möchtest, welche Instanz verwendet werden soll, speichere Zugangsdaten, die einen Instanz-CRN enthalten.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save credentials for automatic instance selection: {#save-credentials-for-automatic-instance-selection}"
msgstr "Zugangsdaten für automatische Instanzauswahl speichern: {#save-credentials-for-automatic-instance-selection}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't provide an instance CRN and pass these credentials to Quantum Compute, an appropriate instance will be chosen for you, based on the specified options.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du keinen Instanz-CRN angibst und diese Zugangsdaten an Quantum Compute übergibst, wird automatisch eine geeignete Instanz für dich ausgewählt, basierend auf den angegebenen Optionen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2 {#example-2}"
msgstr "Beispiel 2 {#example-2}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example saves credentials for automatic instance selection.  Quantum Compute will only look at premium instances in the EU region that are available to the account. These credentials become the new default.\n"
msgstr "Dieses Beispiel speichert Zugangsdaten für die automatische Instanzauswahl. Quantum Compute berücksichtigt dabei ausschließlich Premium-Instanzen in der EU-Region, die dem Konto zur Verfügung stehen. Diese Zugangsdaten werden zum neuen Standard.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View saved credentials {#view-saved-credentials}"
msgstr "Gespeicherte Zugangsdaten anzeigen {#view-saved-credentials}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To view all credentials that you have saved, run `service.saved_accounts()`.  Note that if you saved default credentials and didn't name them, they are named `default-ibm-quantum-platform`. If you did name your default credentials, you will see `\"is_default_account\": true` in the output.\n"
msgstr "Um alle gespeicherten Zugangsdaten anzuzeigen, führe `service.saved_accounts()` aus. Wenn du Standardzugangsdaten gespeichert hast, ohne ihnen einen Namen zu geben, heißen sie `default-ibm-quantum-platform`. Wenn du deinen Standardzugangsdaten einen Namen gegeben hast, wird `\"is_default_account\": true` in der Ausgabe angezeigt.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations {#considerations}"
msgstr "Hinweise {#considerations}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are saving multiple accounts, use the `name` parameter to differentiate them.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du mehrere Konten speicherst, verwende den Parameter `name`, um sie voneinander zu unterscheiden.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credentials are saved to `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json`.  Do not manually edit this file.\n"
msgstr "Zugangsdaten werden unter `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json` gespeichert. Bearbeite diese Datei nicht manuell.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't save your credentials, you must specify them every time you start a new session (instantiate IBM Quantum Compute Service).\n"
msgstr "Wenn du deine Zugangsdaten nicht speicherst, musst du sie jedes Mal neu angeben, wenn du eine neue Sitzung startest (d. h. den IBM Quantum Compute Service instanziierst).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you manually specify your credentials, a saved account will not be used.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du deine Zugangsdaten manuell angibst, werden gespeicherte Konten nicht verwendet.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Nächste Schritte {#next-steps}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account) in a trusted Python environment.\n"
"  -  [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service in an **untrusted environment**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"  -  [View your available QPUs](/guides/qpu-information#available).\n"
"  -  [Configure the Qiskit SDK locally](/guides/configure-qiskit-local).\n"
"  -  Follow the steps in the [Run your first circuit on hardware](/guides/hello-world) guide to write and run a quantum program.\n"
"  -  [Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
"  -  Try a [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlungen\">\n"
"  -  [IBM Quantum Compute Service initialisieren](/guides/initialize-account) in einer vertrauenswürdigen Python-Umgebung.\n"
"  -  [IBM Quantum Compute Service in einer **nicht vertrauenswürdigen Umgebung** initialisieren.](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted)\n"
"  -  [Verfügbare QPUs anzeigen.](/guides/qpu-information#available)\n"
"  -  [Das Qiskit SDK lokal konfigurieren.](/guides/configure-qiskit-local)\n"
"  -  Folge den Schritten in [Hello world](/guides/hello-world), um ein Quantenprogramm zu schreiben und auszuführen.\n"
"  -  [IBM Quantum Platform mit REST API einrichten.](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api)\n"
"  -  Probiere ein [Tutorial.](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
